    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Canoptek Court",
    "summary": "The **Power Matrix** of your army contains:\n\n- Your own deployment zone, permanently\n- **No Man's Land** for any phase that begins with you controlling half or more of its objective markers\n- The opposing deployment zone, judged the same way\n\nFor attacks by models in your **CRYPTEK** and **CANOPTEK** units, Hit rolls of 1 may be re-rolled; while their unit is wholly within the Power Matrix, any Hit roll may be re-rolled instead.",
